\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces The door. Strength of the matched-pair witness, $\log _{10}R_{\rm  ret}$ at $\tau =4$, against the time the hidden difference was planted (in units of $\epsilon _{\rm  dec}$) and the moment that held it. Planted deep in the coupled era the difference is erased, down to $10^{-30}$; planted at or after decoupling it returns at the $10^{-1}$ level. The red plane is the witness threshold $10^{-3}$. The steeper history ($n=6$) closes the door more sharply.}}{9}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:door}{{5}{9}{The door. Strength of the matched-pair witness, $\log _{10}R_{\rm ret}$ at $\tau =4$, against the time the hidden difference was planted (in units of $\epsilon _{\rm dec}$) and the moment that held it. Planted deep in the coupled era the difference is erased, down to $10^{-30}$; planted at or after decoupling it returns at the $10^{-1}$ level. The red plane is the witness threshold $10^{-3}$. The steeper history ($n=6$) closes the door more sharply}{figure.5}{}}
