\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces The flux--shear link. Left: the surviving share $G$ against the link's reflection coefficient $\Gamma _{12}$, eleven thresholds from McCormick's code with the shear and higher moments relaxing at $r$ times the flux rate. Right: the offset of $G$ against the link rapidity $\tfrac  12\ln r$, with the shear-only pairs (squares); the shaded band is the admissible window $\tfrac  34\le r\le \tfrac  32$. Lines: rate one (dashed) and the inner-pair rate $1.11$.}}{13}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:link}{{6}{13}{The flux--shear link. Left: the surviving share $G$ against the link's reflection coefficient $\Gamma _{12}$, eleven thresholds from McCormick's code with the shear and higher moments relaxing at $r$ times the flux rate. Right: the offset of $G$ against the link rapidity $\tfrac 12\ln r$, with the shear-only pairs (squares); the shaded band is the admissible window $\tfrac 34\le r\le \tfrac 32$. Lines: rate one (dashed) and the inner-pair rate $1.11$}{figure.6}{}}
